{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6baecd31-3a4c-8b75-93ca-1baa93238f4f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T14:20:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Priya. Gino Conti. I'm calling about my water and sewer bill. It came in this week and it's a lot higher than I expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look at that. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "45 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up the North End. Down from where the bank used to be, if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is enough, thank you. Give me a moment to pull up the account. [pause] Okay, I have it. This is the bill dated in December?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. Now, last year my winter bills were much lower. Way lower. I'm one person in the house, nothing's changed that I know of, and I'm not running a laundromat in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the prior winter on the account, and yes, the usage on this bill is higher. The reading went up compared to the same period last year. Is there anything different at the house? A toilet that runs, a leaky faucet, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've noticed. I walked around, didn't see anything. No wet spots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A running toilet is the most common cause, and it's often silent. You can put a few drops of food coloring in the tank and see if it shows up in the bowl without flushing. That would tell you something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can do that. Food coloring. Let me write that down. [pause] Alright. Now, is there any discount? For low-income or elderly households? I'm in my seventies, on a fixed income."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not aware of a standing discount program for the water and sewer bill based on age or income. I can transfer you to the billing supervisor, who would know for certain if there's any assistance, or I can have them call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Have them call me. Landline, 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160. Got it. Is there a best time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are good. I'm up early but I'm home by noon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons, noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if I think the charge is wrong, how do I dispute it formally? Is there a form, or do I write a letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd submit a written request for review to the utilities billing office. Include your name, the service address, the account number, the bill date, and what you're disputing and why. We can also schedule a meter re-read or check, which is usually the first step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get that re-read set up now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in the request. Someone will need to come to the property, so they'll contact you to arrange access if the meter's inside. Is it inside or outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Inside, in the cellar, by the stairs. You can't miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've noted that. Is the name on the account Gino Conti?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gino Conti, C-O-N-T-I. Yeah. You know, I read every sign on the way to the office, every morning, been doing it for years. Habit. That's why I noticed the bill had a notice on it about disputes, but it didn't say how."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. The notice is general. I'll make a note on the account that you've asked about a dispute and a re-read, so it's on file while you gather your letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's all I need. Thank you, Priya."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Conti. Someone will call you this week. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:20:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
